OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 270 homes refused for
OL,4,Asecond time
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for up to 270 homes on the edge
OL,7,Fof a Lincolnshire town have been
OL,8,Frefused for a second time.
OL,10,FThe plans for land south-west of Bourne
OL,11,Fwere originally rejected by South
OL,12,FKesteven District Council in August
OL,13,Fover concerns about their impact on the
OL,14,Flandscape and character of the area.
OL,16,FThe application was reconsidered under
OL,17,Fthe revised National Planning Policy
OL,18,FFramework (NPPF), with applicants
OL,19,FBarratt Redrow and Cooke Trustees
OL,20,FFarming arguing the changes placed
OL,21,Fgreater weight on housing delivery.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
