OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 270 homes refused for
OL,4,Asecond time
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, councillors voted unanimously
OL,7,Fto refuse the scheme. The application
OL,8,Fwill now be referred to the secretary
OL,9,Fof state before any formal refusal can
OL,10,Fbe issued.
